WEBVTT

00:11:29.886 --> 00:11:34.357
If I never take accountability
to drive my own internal change,

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.926
then no matter what external
change I make,

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.362
I will likely keep suffering
from the same patterns

00:11:39.395 --> 00:11:40.797
over and over again.

00:11:41.664 --> 00:11:45.235
Now, all that being said and all that
being something I strongly believe in,

00:11:45.235 --> 00:11:47.971
I am also a realist and I know
that not all of us

00:11:48.004 --> 00:11:50.673
will be ready to do our own
deep personal work yet.

00:11:50.707 --> 00:11:52.675
So where else can we start on this topic?

00:11:52.709 --> 00:11:54.110
What else can we do?

00:11:54.143 --> 00:11:56.045
I'll offer three smaller steps.

00:11:56.479 --> 00:11:57.747
First,

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:01.050
when you find yourself wanting to say
"we're like family" around work